  <excerpt>At the tail end of winter, as the first bits of spring began to arrive, Rachel and Justin gathered their families from St. Louis and Atlanta in iconic Forest Park for their wedding at the Norman K Probstein Golf Course. Mimicking the colors of the changing seasons, they enjoyed an elegant event with soft pinks, greens and gold.</excerpt>
  <content>
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__wide" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555381213/Posts/Files/up_close_picture_of_bride_and_groom_smiling__tse89g" alt="up close picture of bride and groom smiling" width="1000" height="664" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the tail end of winter, as the first bits of spring began to arrive, Rachel and Justin gathered their families from St. Louis and Atlanta in iconic Forest Park for their wedding at the &lt;a href="https://www.forestparkgc.com/"&gt;Norman K Probstein Golf Course&lt;/a&gt;. Mimicking the colors of the changing seasons, they enjoyed an elegant event with soft pinks, greens and gold.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__tall" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555381043/Posts/Files/African_American_groom_getting_ready_for_wedding_ceremony_in_Forest_Park_Golf_Course__fpyioq" alt="African American groom getting ready for wedding ceremony in Forest Park Golf Course" width="664" height="1000" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__tall" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555381043/Posts/Files/Grooms_tie_on_his_neck__ktbuud" alt="Grooms tie on his neck" width="664" height="1000" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__wide" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555381044/Posts/Files/wedding_bouquet_in_St_Louis_MO__vdt5vh" alt="wedding bouquet in St Louis MO" width="1000" height="664" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__tall" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555381045/Posts/Files/wedding_bouquet_on_floor_diagnonal__mowdob" alt="wedding bouquet on floor diagnonal" width="664" height="1000" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__tall" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555381045/Posts/Files/bride_with_spray_getting_ready_for_her_wedding__dpmnrq" alt="bride with spray getting ready for her wedding" width="667" height="1000" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__wide" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555381046/Posts/Files/reflection_of_bride_in_makeup_kit_with_bright_colors__dcer53" alt="reflection of bride in makeup kit with bright colors" width="1000" height="664" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__wide" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555381046/Posts/Files/mother_of_the_bride_and_her_sister_prepare_her_wedding_dress_in_St._Louis__wygjfj" alt="mother of the bride and her sister prepare her wedding dress in St. Louis" width="1000" height="667" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__wide" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555381047/Posts/Files/Amazed_groom_sees_his_bride_at_first_look_in_Forest_Park__bvqkyj" alt="Amazed groom sees his bride at first look in Forest Park" width="1000" height="667" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__wide" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555381047/Posts/Files/wedding_ceremony_in_Forest_Park_Golf_Course__q9cg2s" alt="wedding ceremony in Forest Park Golf Course" width="1000" height="664" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rachel&amp;rsquo;s billowy fabrics in her dress brought a softness, complimented by the punchy, exciting gold of their decor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__wide" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555381210/Posts/Files/African_American_bride_looks_at_her_groom_during_wedding_ceremony_at_Norman_K_Probstein_Golf_Course___vtuhzu" alt="African American bride looks at her groom during wedding ceremony at Norman K Probstein Golf Course" width="1000" height="667" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__wide" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555381211/Posts/Files/couple_kissing_and_laughing_during_you_may_kiss_the_bride__rypoob" alt="couple kissing and laughing during you may kiss the bride" width="1992" height="1000" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__tall" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555381212/Posts/Files/bride_with_braids_laughing_with_high_key_lighting__embbxe" alt="bride with braids laughing with high key lighting" width="664" height="1000" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__tall" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555381213/Posts/Files/couple_embracing_in_posed_picture_in_Forest_Park_indoors__bv23ps" alt="couple embracing in posed picture in Forest Park indoors" width="664" height="1000" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rachel and Justin had such a laid back spirit that was full of joy at their new marriage and reception.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__wide" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555381400/Posts/Files/wedding_rings_on_two_different_darker_complexions__lg7lix" alt="wedding rings on two different darker complexions" width="1000" height="664" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__tall" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555381400/Posts/Files/couple_walking_towards_St._Louis_statue_on_Art_Hill_on_wedding_day__lqxhnb" alt="couple walking towards St. Louis statue on Art Hill on wedding day" width="664" height="1000" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__tall" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555381401/Posts/Files/bride_and_goom_kissing_at_the_top_of_art_hill_in_forest_park__ruhj9j" alt="bride and groom kissing at the top of art hill in forest park" width="664" height="1000" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__wide" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555382663/Posts/Files/black_and_white_portrait_of_wedding_couple_in_near_art_museum_in_STL__tbnwak" alt="black and white portrait of wedding couple in near art museum in STL" width="1000" height="664" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__wide" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555382663/Posts/Files/bride_glancing_down_with_groom_smiling_at_top_of_Art_Hill_in_Forest_Park_St._Louis__u3gs28" alt="bride glancing down with groom smiling at top of Art Hill in Forest Park St. Louis" width="1000" height="664" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__tall" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555382664/Posts/Files/couple_smiling_on_wedding_day__kvuq6c" alt="couple smiling on wedding day" width="664" height="1000" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__tall" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555382664/Posts/Files/Norman_K_Probstein_Golf_Course_reception__d2tqog" alt="Norman K Probstein Golf Course reception" width="664" height="1000" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__tall" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555382709/Posts/Files/St._Louis_wedding_cake_by_La_Patisserie_Chouquette__eqt2fd" alt="St. Louis wedding cake by La Patisserie Chouquette" width="664" height="1000" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__tall" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555382709/Posts/Files/St._Louis_wedding_cake_cutting_by_La_Patisserie_Chouquette__lszm9r" alt="St. Louis wedding cake cutting by La Patisserie Chouquette" width="664" height="1000" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It was a wonderful celebration as their guests danced their hearts out and stayed until their sparkler departure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__wide" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555381536/Posts/Files/laughter_at_wedding_reception_in_St._Louis__tusvla" alt="laughter at wedding reception in St. Louis" width="1000" height="667" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__tall" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555382395/Posts/Files/dancing_at_wedding_reception__xv7vyq" alt="dancing at wedding reception" width="667" height="1000" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__tall" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555382396/Posts/Files/family_dancing_at_wedding_reception_in_St._Louis__owtp1f" alt="family dancing at wedding reception in St. Louis" width="667" height="1000" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__tall" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555382397/Posts/Files/Rachel_Justin_Wedding-314__ggnrla" alt="Couples dancing at wedding reception" width="667" height="1000" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__wide" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555382457/Posts/Files/wedding_reception_dancing_in_Forest_Park__iknxbq" alt="wedding reception dancing in Forest Park" width="1000" height="664" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;ve seen many dances that celebrate the longest marriages in the room, but this was my absolute favorite.&amp;nbsp; The whole room was cheering as these special grandparents continued dancing as the DJ called out more and more years of their marriage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__wide" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555382458/Posts/Files/family_cheers_at_wedding_reception__ubdobc" alt="family cheers at wedding reception" width="1000" height="664" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="image__wide" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/purple-lemon-photography/image/upload/f_auto,fl_lossy.keep_attribution,q_auto/v1555382528/Posts/Files/Reception_Sparkler_exit_at_Norman_K_Probstein_Golf_Course__f9z695" alt="Reception Sparkler exit at Norman K Probstein Golf Course" width="1000" height="664" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;d prayed for Rachel shortly before their wedding and told her I was praying for their marriage into their old age, and perhaps it will be quite the celebration when their children and grandchildren cheer for them as well.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Vendors:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hair Styling | &lt;a href="https://urbaneboozerthehairexperience.business.site/"&gt;Constance at Urbaneboozer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bakery | &lt;a href="https://www.simonefaure.com"&gt;La Patisserie Chouquette&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DJ services | DJ A. Eye&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Venue for both ceremony and reception | &lt;a href="https://www.forestparkgc.com/"&gt;Norman K Probstein Golf Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
